+You can require all payment methods to be saved by configuring `setup_future_usage`. Using `setup_future_usage` disables one-time payment methods, like most [BNPLs](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/buy-now-pay-later.md). To support both one-time and reusable payment methods, configure future usage on specific payment methods, such as [payment_method_options[card][setup_future_usage]](https://docs.stripe.com/api/payment_intents/object.md#payment_intent_object-payment_method_options-card-setup_future_usage) to save cards. |
