+- Charging for an initial purchase while also saving the payment method for incidentals or add-on purchases |
+| **Get started** | [Accept and set up a payment with Payment Sheet](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/mobile/accept-payment.md?integration=paymentsheet&type=paymentsfu) |
